  "paragraphs": [
    [
      "P001",
      "Step\n8A\nRemove socket head cap screws and lockwashers in impeller nut (26).",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P002",
      "Impeller nut can now be\nremoved using the special wrench provided.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P003",
      "9A",
      false,
      "heading",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P004",
      "Remove Impeller (2) take care not to damage the wear rings (if so equipped).",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P005",
      "NOTE: On pump sizes F12 and above, the impeller is provided with a tapered bore.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P006",
      "If pump size is F10\nand below, the impeller is provided with a straight bore.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P007",
      "Do not lose impeller key (32).",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P008",
      "10A Remove packing gland (17).",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P009",
      "11A Remove bolting from between volute cover (11) and bearing housing (19).",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P010",
      "12A Remove bearing housing assembly with bearing housing (19), shaft (6) and bearings (16 & 18) as\na unit from the volute cover (11).",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P011",
      "13A Shaft sleeve (14) can now be removed from shaft (6).",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P012",
      "14A Remove packing rings (13) and lantern ring (29).",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P013",
      "15A Loosen set screws in shaft sleeve nut (20) and unscrew shaft sleeve nut from shaft (6).",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P014",
      "16A If pump was supplied with metal flinger (40). loosen set screws and slide off of shaft.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P015",
      "If pump was\nsupplied with flexible V-rings, these can now be removed from the radial bearing cover (35) and\nthrust bearing cover (37) by stretching them as needed to remove from shaft (6).",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P016",
      "17A Remove radial bearing cover (35).",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P017",
      "18A Unscrew and remove short section of pipe provided as thrust bearing grease drain (if applicable)\nprotruding from side of bearing housing (19) at the thrust bearings.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P018",
      "19A Remove bolting holding thrust bearing cover (37) and lift cover from pump.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P019",
      "20A Removing bolting between thrust bearing cartridge (141) and bearing housing (19), if applicable.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P020",
      "21 A Remove shaft (6), bearings (16 & 18), and thrust bearing cartridge (141) from bearing housing\n(19) as a unit.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P021",
      "22A",
      false,
      "heading",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P022",
      "Loosen and remove locknut (22) and lockwasher (69) holding radial bearing (16) to shaft.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001",
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P023",
      "23A Press radial bearing (16) from shaft WORKING AGAINST THE INNER RACE OF THE BEARING.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001",
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P024",
      "(Refer to Figure6)\nWARNING ! !",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001",
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P025",
      "Failure to use this procedure can damage the bearing.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001",
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P026",
      "24A Remove locknut (22) and lockwasher (69) holding thrust bearings (18) to shaft (6).",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001",
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P027",
      "25A Press thrust bearing cartridge (141) towards impeller end of shaft until free from thrust bearings\n(18).",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001",
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P028",
      "17",
      false,
      "prose",
      "21:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001",
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P029",
      "26A Thrust bearings (18) can be removed by WORKING AGAINST THE INNER RACE OF THE\nINNER MOST BEARING. (Refer to Figure 6)\nWARNING ! !",
      true,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P030",
      "Failure to use this procedure can damage the bearing.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P031",
      "27A Slide thrust bearing cartridge (141) off shaft.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P032",
      "28A",
      true,
      "heading",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P033",
      "If pump was provided with grease seals (51) for the thrust (37) and radial (35) bearing covers and\nthe thrust bearing cartridge (141) these should be inspected for any visible damage and replaced,\nif necessary.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S003"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P034",
      "29A Pump is now completely disassembled with the exception of the wear rings (8 & 25) and stuffing\nbox bushing (15 & 27, if supplied).",
      true,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S003"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P035",
      "All of these items have an interference fit with their respective\npieces.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S003"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P036",
      "To disassemble, remove their respective locking devices and pry out working uniformly at\n180° points.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S003"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P037",
      "NOTE: Wear rings and stuffing box bushings should not be removed unless it is necessary to replace\nthem with new parts.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S003"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P038",
      "18",
      true,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S003"
      ]
